# The Vosk model archive is a third-party 44 MB binary. It is published to
# GitHub Releases by publish-model.ps1 and only voice-model.json (a few hundred
# bytes) belongs in git. Committing the zip would double the repository size on
# every model update and git has no use for a file that never changes.
model/

# wrangler's local cache: account metadata and build artefacts, machine-specific and not
# part of the receiver. The worker source and wrangler.toml are tracked; this is not.
.wrangler/
